  "question": {
    "text": "Consider a rubber ball freely falling from a height $h=4.9 \\mathrm{~m}$ onto a horizontal elastic plate. Assume that the duration of collision is negligible and the collision with the plate is totally elastic. Then the velocity as a function of time the height as function of time will be",
