  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\mathrm{h}=\\frac{1}{2} \\mathrm{gt}^2, \\quad \\mathrm{v}=-\\mathrm{gt}$ and after the collision, $\\mathrm{v}=\\mathrm{gt}$.\n(parabolic) (straight line)\nCollision is perfectly elastic then ball reaches to same height again and again with same velocity.\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/gqTIJI9AXY8oHYAZxQtovzHUqa0TQ0yiL2zJp-_tv04.original.fullsize.png\"><br><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/iuFU420RP5EZkOJmxH3LHroXFfPOzesfbDjT-kJ1uQM.original.fullsize.png\"><br>",
